    "text": "A liquid is immiscible in water was steam distilled at 95.2<sup>o</sup>C at a pressure of 0.983 atm. What is the mass of the liquid present per gram of water in the distillate. Molar mass of the liquid is 134.3 g/mol and the vapour pressure of water is 0.84 atm. Also, Vapour pressure of pure liquid is 0.143 atm.",
